    <briefdescription>
<para>Pose and velocity data for the head / <ref refid="classILLIXR_1_1HMD" kindref="compound">HMD</ref>, with a timestamp. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends <computeroutput><ref refid="structILLIXR_1_1data__format_1_1pose_1_1head__pose__data" kindref="compound">head_pose_data</ref></computeroutput> with linear and angular velocity reported by the OpenXR runtime via <computeroutput>XrSpaceVelocity</computeroutput>. Each velocity component carries its own validity flag because the runtime may provide one without the other.</para>
<para>Velocities are expressed in the same reference space as the pose (local space by convention in this plugin) and in SI units:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>linear_velocity</computeroutput> — metres per second</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>angular_velocity</computeroutput> — radians per second (axis-angle, right-hand rule) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
